  "description": "Compound unit names (spec \u00a7 4.3) on a molecule: a density grid in e_per_bohr3, a Laplacian grid in e_per_bohr5, a potential in hartree_per_e and an electric field (volume.vector) in hartree_per_e_bohr. Trajectory velocities and gradient restate angstrom_per_fs and hartree_per_bohr, QTAIM rho and laplacian are declared in e_per_bohr3 and e_per_bohr5, a quadrupole restates debye_angstrom and a polarizability e2_bohr2_per_hartree, and a custom atom_properties role in ev_per_angstrom. Every value is stored in its declared unit and nothing is converted.",
